{"id": "L10", "command": "submit", "inputs": {"recommendation": {"decision": "keep", "challenger": null, "diagnosis": "Volatility is calm in MX and BR while markups have widened in every corridor; the champion's overall error edged down, but the India corridor became much harder to forecast than it was a half-year ago and early-April shocks drove the worst days. No configuration change tested shows an advantage beyond noise.", "evidence": [{"claim": "The champion's error over the last 26 weeks was 60.81 bps vs 62.22 bps before (-2.27%), an improvement overall.", "ledger_ids": ["L02"]}, {"claim": "The IN corridor got worse: 30.74 bps over the last 26 weeks vs 9.11 bps in the prior 26 weeks, while MX improved from 97.74 bps to 73.66 bps.", "ledger_ids": ["L02"]}, {"claim": "The best challengers were only marginally better than the champion: weekly refit at 60.76 bps (-0.08%) and dropping the dollar index at 60.78 bps (-0.05%), far short of the 1% promotion bar.", "ledger_ids": ["L04", "L09"]}, {"claim": "A shorter 1y training window was worse at 62.64 bps (+3.01%), with every corridor worse, so faster adaptation does not help.", "ledger_ids": ["L05"]}, {"claim": "Other families and decay settings were also worse: LightGBM 61.08 bps (+0.44%), ridge 61.16 bps (+0.58%), halflife 5 at 61.23 bps (+0.69%).", "ledger_ids": ["L06", "L08", "L07"]}, {"claim": "The champion shows a mild bias of -8.37 bps in BR and -6.37 bps in MX (forecasting slightly high), with a breach rate of 0.065 inside the 2-9% band.", "ledger_ids": ["L03", "L02"]}], "risks": "The India corridor's higher error may reflect a lasting regime shift the champion's long training window adapts to slowly; widening markups could keep the champion biased in BR and MX; a renewed volatility shock like early April could expose the model.", "watch_next_week": "Track India corridor error and whether markups keep widening; check whether the BR and MX bias persists; revisit shorter refit or markup-focused configs if India error keeps rising."}}, "result": {"accepted": true, "errors": [], "attempt": 1}, "time": "2026-11-15T11:41:08Z"}
